## Article 1. Purpose of the Code of Administrative Court Procedure

```catala
declaration scope Article1Purpose:
  output codeEstablishesJurisdiction content YesNo
  output codeEstablishesCourtProcedure content YesNo

scope Article1Purpose:
  definition codeEstablishesJurisdiction equals Yes
  definition codeEstablishesCourtProcedure equals Yes
```

## Article 2. Tasks and fundamental principles of administrative proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article2ReviewCriteria:
  input hasLegalBasis content YesNo
  input withinAuthority content YesNo
  input properMethod content YesNo
  input properPurpose content YesNo
  input justified content YesNo
  input impartial content YesNo
  input inGoodFaith content YesNo
  input proportionate content YesNo
  input withParticipation content YesNo
  input timely content YesNo
  output allCriteriaMet content YesNo
  output anyCriterionFailed content YesNo

scope Article2ReviewCriteria:
  definition allCriteriaMet equals Yes

  label criteria_failed exception all_criteria_met_default
  definition allCriteriaMet under condition
    hasLegalBasis = No
    or withinAuthority = No
    or properMethod = No
    or properPurpose = No
    or justified = No
    or impartial = No
    or inGoodFaith = No
    or proportionate = No
    or withParticipation = No
    or timely = No
    consequence equals No

  label all_criteria_met_default definition allCriteriaMet equals Yes

  label any_failed_exception exception no_failures
  definition anyCriterionFailed under condition
    hasLegalBasis = No
    or withinAuthority = No
    or properMethod = No
    or properPurpose = No
    or justified = No
    or impartial = No
    or inGoodFaith = No
    or proportionate = No
    or withParticipation = No
    or timely = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_failures definition anyCriterionFailed equals No
```

## Article 3. Legislation on administrative court proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article3LegislationHierarchy:
  input constitutionApplies content YesNo
  input internationalTreatyApplies content YesNo
  input codeProvisionApplies content YesNo
  input lawProvisionApplies content YesNo
  input subordinateActApplies content YesNo
  input legislationIncomplete content YesNo
  input lawNarrowsRights content YesNo
  output applicableNormRank content integer
  output hasRetroactiveEffect content YesNo

scope Article3LegislationHierarchy:
  label constitution_rank definition applicableNormRank equals 1

  label international_exception exception code_rank
  definition applicableNormRank under condition
    internationalTreatyApplies = Yes
    consequence equals 2

  label code_rank definition applicableNormRank equals 3

  label no_retroactivity_default definition hasRetroactiveEffect equals No

  label no_retroactivity_exception exception no_retroactivity_default
  definition hasRetroactiveEffect under condition
    lawNarrowsRights = Yes
    consequence equals No
```
